
@baseUrl  = http://localhost:8080
@validKey = key-internal-cWevfEoRvstUv0PqGpf02LzDY5kPNaz1y9GSl0LZOwU=

###

### [SESSION-1] Create a new session
# @name ragSession
# Expect 201: {"sessionId": "xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx"}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

### Ask a multi-step question with maxIterations=1
# Post-RAG: agent calls ingest_document tool → 202 AWAITING_APPROVAL
# Expected: 202 with toolName=ingest_document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ragSession.response.body.sessionId}}/run
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

{
    "goal": "Ingest This: Write a 500-word essay about the history of Java and then analyze its performance characteristics.",
    "agentRole": "coordinator",
    "maxIterations": 1
}


###

### [HITL-3] Poll status — should show AWAITING_APPROVAL
# Expect 200: {"sessionId":"...","status":"AWAITING_APPROVAL","steps":[...],"failReason":null}
# Run this immediately after HITL-2 before approving
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ragSession.response.body.sessionId}}/status/coordinator
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sessions/{{ragSession.response.body.sessionId}}/approve?agentRole=coordinator
Content-Type: application/json
X-ArcClaw-API-Key: {{validKey}}

###